From 8ac822b0027a373838be4f1321befd6d062b9574 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini experiment archive <noreply@gemini-experiment.invalid>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 14:15:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] wmt: initialize only after recorded recovery takeover

Add a fixed-identity experimental detector request. Preserve every native
initializer result and stop at the first native or capture failure.
Refuse the legacy detector controls in this experimental configuration.

Internal experiment archive; synthetic author, no DCO certification.
